---
// "Scalability! But at what COST?" (McSherry, Isard, Murray, HotOS 2015).
// Time for 20 PageRank iterations on the twitter_rv graph: four 128-core cluster
// systems (their own reported times, paper Table 2) against one thread on a laptop
// (measured by the authors, Tables 2 and 4). Lower is better.
// Plain inline SVG with site tokens; no ids.

const W = 900;
const L = 280; // bars start here
const R = 800; // 900 s ends here
const MAX_S = 900;
const sx = (s: number) => L + (s / MAX_S) * (R - L);

type Row = { en: string; vi: string; subEn: string; subVi: string; s: number; best?: boolean };

const cluster: Row[] = [
  { en: 'Spark', vi: 'Spark', subEn: '128 cores', subVi: '128 core', s: 857 },
  { en: 'Giraph', vi: 'Giraph', subEn: '128 cores', subVi: '128 core', s: 596 },
  { en: 'GraphX', vi: 'GraphX', subEn: '128 cores', subVi: '128 core', s: 419 },
  { en: 'GraphLab', vi: 'GraphLab', subEn: '128 cores', subVi: '128 core', s: 249 },
];
const laptop: Row[] = [
  { en: 'Single thread', vi: 'Một thread', subEn: '1 thread on a laptop, SSD', subVi: '1 thread trên laptop, SSD', s: 300 },
  { en: 'Single thread', vi: 'Một thread', subEn: '1 thread on a laptop, RAM', subVi: '1 thread trên laptop, RAM', s: 275 },
  { en: 'Single thread, Hilbert order', vi: 'Một thread, thứ tự Hilbert', subEn: '1 thread on a laptop, RAM', subVi: '1 thread trên laptop, RAM', s: 110, best: true },
];

const rowH = 30;
const pitch = 42;
const top = 56;
const groupGap = 26;
const rowY = (i: number) => top + i * pitch + (i >= cluster.length ? groupGap : 0);
const rows = [...cluster, ...laptop];
const lastY = rowY(rows.length - 1);
const gridTop = top - 8;
const gridBottom = lastY + rowH + 6;
const groupRuleY = rowY(cluster.length) - groupGap / 2 - 6;
const axisY = lastY + rowH + 26;
const H = axisY + 34;
const BEST = laptop[laptop.length - 1].s;
const ticks = [0, 200, 400, 600, 800];
---
<figure class="costsc">
  <div class="costsc-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Seconds for 20 PageRank iterations on the Twitter graph. On 128 cores: Spark 857, Giraph 596, GraphX 419, GraphLab 249. On one laptop thread: 300 with data on SSD, 275 in RAM, and 110 in RAM with the edges in Hilbert-curve order, faster than every cluster system.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="costsc-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Time for 20 PageRank iterations on the Twitter graph</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thời gian chạy 20 vòng PageRank trên đồ thị Twitter</tspan>
    </text>

    {ticks.map((t) => (
      <line x1={sx(t)} x2={sx(t)} y1={gridTop} y2={gridBottom} class="costsc-grid" />
    ))}

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1={groupRuleY} y2={groupRuleY} class="costsc-rule" />

    {rows.map((r, i) => {
      const y = rowY(i);
      return (
        <g class={r.best ? 'costsc-row is-best' : 'costsc-row'}>
          <text x="20" y={y + 13} class="costsc-name">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{r.en}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi}</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x="20" y={y + 30} class="costsc-sub">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{r.subEn}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{r.subVi}</tspan>
          </text>
          <rect x={L} y={y + 2} width={sx(r.s) - L} height={rowH - 4} rx="3" class="costsc-bar" />
          <text x={sx(r.s) + 8} y={y + 20} class="costsc-val">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{r.s} s{r.best ? ', faster than every cluster above' : ''}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{r.s} giây{r.best ? ', nhanh hơn mọi cụm máy ở trên' : ''}</tspan>
          </text>
        </g>
      );
    })}

    {/* reference line at the laptop's best time */}
    <line x1={sx(BEST)} x2={sx(BEST)} y1={gridTop} y2={gridBottom} class="costsc-ref" />

    {ticks.map((t) => (
      <text x={sx(t)} y={axisY} text-anchor="middle" class="costsc-tick">{t}</text>
    ))}
    <text x={W - 20} y={axisY + 20} text-anchor="end" class="costsc-tick">
      <tspan data-lang-en>seconds, lower is better</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>giây, càng thấp càng tốt</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Elapsed time for 20 iterations of PageRank on the twitter_rv graph. The cluster times are the systems' own reported numbers on 128 cores; the single-thread times were measured by the authors on a high-end 2014 laptop. The authors call these comparisons "neither perfect nor always fair". Source: McSherry, Isard, Murray, <a href="https://www.usenix.org/system/files/conference/hotos15/hotos15-paper-mcsherry.pdf" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Scalability! But at what COST?</a> (HotOS 2015), Tables 2 and 4.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Thời gian chạy 20 vòng PageRank trên đồ thị twitter_rv. Số của các cụm máy là con số chính các hệ thống đó công bố, chạy trên 128 core; số chạy một thread do các tác giả tự đo trên một chiếc laptop cao cấp đời 2014. Chính các tác giả nói những phép so sánh này "neither perfect nor always fair" (không hoàn hảo, cũng không phải lúc nào cũng công bằng). Nguồn: McSherry, Isard, Murray, <a href="https://www.usenix.org/system/files/conference/hotos15/hotos15-paper-mcsherry.pdf" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Scalability! But at what COST?</a> (HotOS 2015), bảng 2 và 4.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .costsc {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .costsc-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .costsc svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .costsc text {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .costsc .costsc-h {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .costsc .costsc-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .costsc .costsc-sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .costsc-grid,
  .costsc-rule {
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .costsc-bar {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .costsc-row.is-best .costsc-bar {
    fill: var(--red);
  }
  .costsc .costsc-row.is-best .costsc-val {
    fill: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .costsc-ref {
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }
  .costsc .costsc-tick {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .costsc figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
